  "notes": [
    "Byte-level goldens for gr-uwb/include/gnuradio/uwb/uwb_twr_frame.h.",
    "This file is TEST DATA, not documentation: qa_uwb_twr_frame.cc reads it",
    "via UWB_TESTDATA_DIR and fails if it disagrees with the codec, with the",
    "hand-written byte table in the QA, or internally.",
    "The bytes were derived by hand from the frozen field table and checked",
    "with an independent serialiser, not by running the codec under test.",
    "mac_payload_hex is the MAC PSDU WITHOUT the FCS. Exactly one layer",
    "appends the FCS: the HRP modulation layer, UwbHrpPacketSource with",
    "append_fcs=true calling mod::append_ieee_fcs (REQ-API-01).",
    "All multi-byte fields and every timestamp are little-endian.",
    "Phase-1 profile: 40-bit timestamps at the X410 device tick rate."
